OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's safety standards urged
OL,4,Aacross hotels
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity working with a hotel chain to
OL,7,Ftackle violence against women and girls
OL,8,Ffollowing an independent review is
OL,9,Fcalling for industry-wide standards.
OL,11,FTravelodge is consulting with personal
OL,12,Fsafety charity Suzy Lamplugh Trust
OL,13,F(SLT) after a review of the chain found
OL,14,Fguests were still not as safe as they
OL,15,Fshould be.
OL,17,FThe review came after the BBC revealed
OL,18,Fhow a woman woke up to a man sexually
OL,19,Fassaulting her in her bed at the
OL,20,Fchain's Maidenhead branch in December
OL,21,F2022 after staff gave him a key card
OL,22,Fand her room number.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
