OL,3,GNEWSAWomen's safety standards urged
OL,4,Aacross hotels
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaskia Garner, head of policy and
OL,7,Fcampaigns at SLT, said the incidents
OL,8,Fhighlighted in the review "need to be a
OL,9,Fwake-up call to all organisations
OL,10,Facross the hospitality sector".
